<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="description" content="The Talon Expeditions page you requested could not be found."/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,follow"/><link rel="canonical" href={new URL('/404.html',Astro.site)}/><title>Page Not Found | Talon Expeditions</title></head><body><main class="av-404"><div class="av-404-image" style={`background-image:url('${illustration}');background-size:contain;background-repeat:no-repeat;background-color:#fff`}></div><div class="av-404-copy"><span class="av-404-code">404</span><h1>Oops! You’ve Missed the Route</h1><p>Looks like the destination you are looking for does not exist or may have moved. But do not worry, your next adventure is still only a click away.</p><a class="button" href="/">Back to Home</a></div></main></body></html>
